How do I troubleshoot WAP problems?

You will find WPA auth log info in /var/log/syslog file:
tail -f /var/log/syslog

Find out if DHCPD relay working or not using the tcpdump command:
tcpdump -n port 67 or port 68

Make sure firewall is not blocking required ports:
/sbin/iptables -L -n -v | less

Make sure correct mac address are assigned and br0 is up and running using the ifconfig command or ip command:
ifconfig br0
ifconfig | grep HW
brctl show

brctl showmacs br0

